When all v0 tickets are done — do this in order:

1. Ship checklist (real usage)

 Two phones: sign up → invite wife → both add Entries

 PWA: Add to Home Screen (iOS + Android)

 Home: net, accounts, donut, recent list

 RLS: second household can’t see your data
 
2. Deploy (ADR-0005)
Push to GitHub → connect Vercel
Set VITE_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
Supabase Auth → add production URL to redirect allowlist
Run migrations on prod Supabase if not already
3. Close the loop
Close #7 and optionally #1 (spec delivered)
Tick .docs/01-project-vision.md success criteria
Commit/push anything still local (.docs/, ADRs, etc.)